        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "B33172C960770706",
      "text": "Oh? The new Champion everybody is talking\\nabout—is it actually you, sweetie?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "79B2A1CC9A614F59",
      "text": "It sure is!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "79B29ECC9A614A40",
      "text": "That’s me! The new Champion!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "B33173C9607708B9",
      "text": "Hurray! I guessed correctly! I suppose that makes\\nsense, though. You sure were strong![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "B33174C960770A6C",
      "text": "You really looked like you were enjoying yourself\\nwhen you tried my sweet treats, too.\\c\\nPeople like that always have great potential.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "B33175C960770C1F",
      "text": "So you’re here on an errand for the Top\\nChampion, are you?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "B33176C960770DD2",
      "text": "I had completely forgotten that she was\\nsupposed to be going around for inspections![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "B33177C960770F85",
      "text": "Thankfully, I just happened to be here today to\\ngive cakes to my staff. Phew. Lucky me![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "B33178C960771138",
      "text": "Very well, then. Is it time for me to get a taste of\\nour new Champion’s strength?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_retry",
      "hash64": "E737D6A2FCBCFCE2",
      "text": "Oh? Are you here to let me have a taste of our\\nnew Champion’s strength?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "B33179C9607712EB",
      "text": "Hehe. Oh, what fun! Let’s go somewhere more\\nsuited for battling.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
